<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Chelan County P.U.D., Wash..</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Chelan County P.U.D., Wash..</headline>
<text>
<p>Public Utility District No. 1 of Chelan County</p>
<p>RE: $287,218,546.30</p>
<p>Washington</p>
<p>Columbia River-Rock Island Hydro-Electric System</p>
<p>Revenue Refunding Bonds</p>
<p>Series 1997 A and Series 1997 B (Taxable)</p>
<p>Effective at 9:30 A.M. E.S.T., Wednesday, March 5, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
